{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Provisional independent non-author per-block review receipt for Group19's exact signed candidate dd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680, posted before the first Gerrit push as required by Bitumen's acceptance criteria. All 108 selected comment regions across the 6 declared infra/compose paths preserve current configuration and operator contracts, leave noncomment payload/protected directives/unlisted lines unchanged, and strictly shrink 8,961→2,148 words. The full focused DD on this exact SHA passed 304 tests with 23 expected skips. A second receipt will cite the exact merged SHA after Gerrit lands.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:1-25\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L1-L25\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L1-L6\tFour services run on the AL2023 arm64 host: Gerrit, review-bot, opcert, and MCP. Host nginx terminates TLS and proxies to their published ports. fetch-secrets.sh rebuilds the sibling .env from SSM on each boot. Persist only Gerrit's stateful site directories on EBS. Mounting all of /var/gerrit would hide the image binaries. compose-up.sh seeds config and plugins before boot. External volumes survive docker compose down -v.\tPASS\t236\t71\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:30-32\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L30-L32\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L11-L11\tAdd Python and g2p hooks to the Gerrit image for container-side CI.\tPASS\t41\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:39-40\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L39-L40\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L18-L18\tHTTP stays on host loopback behind nginx.\tPASS\t24\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:42-42\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L42-L42\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L20-L20\tSSH is exposed directly on 29418.\tPASS\t11\t6\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:45-49\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L45-L49\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L23-L24\tExternal EBS-backed site volumes survive docker compose down -v. Mount only stateful directories so image binaries remain visible.\tPASS\t64\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:57-62\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L57-L62\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L32-L33\tMount the SSM-materialized GitHub deploy key and SSH settings directly. The replication plugin reads them as the Gerrit user's ~/.ssh.\tPASS\t69\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:64-66\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L64-L66\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L35-L35\tg2p reads its SSM-materialized config and GitHub PAT here.\tPASS\t35\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:69-70\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L69-L70\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L38-L38\tMatch the nginx public origin and seeded canonicalWebUrl.\tPASS\t21\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:72-73\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L72-L73\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L40-L40\tSend container output to the host journal.\tPASS\t21\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:80-80\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L80-L80\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L47-L47\tBuild from the repository root for the package install.\tPASS\t13\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:85-115\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L85-L115\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L52-L57\tAllow an in-flight review and its store write to finish on SIGTERM. The 1320s grace covers the 1200s review drain, 60s lock acquisition, and 45s push reconcile lock, with 15s margin. Lock-held git calls and cancellation have their own bounds. A SIGKILL inside the mkdir lock would leave the next container unable to reclaim it. The review-bot stop-grace test checks this budget relationship.\tPASS\t357\t67\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:120-140\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L120-L140\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L62-L66\tPush each code_review artifact through the persistent tickets clone. The entrypoint obtains its URL-scoped credential from the PAT. Trust the bridge gateway's forwarded scheme for nginx redirects. The port is host-loopback only and nginx overwrites X-Forwarded-Proto, so a client cannot supply the trusted scheme.\tPASS\t249\t49\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:142-144\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L142-L144\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L68-L68\tAccept Gerrit's canonical X-Origin-Url only from its compose peer.\tPASS\t31\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:149-152\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L149-L152\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L73-L74\tUse the mounted container path for the SSM-materialized signing key. The host path in .env is not visible inside this container.\tPASS\t52\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:154-156\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L154-L156\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L76-L76\tWrite ticket events to the persistent pushable clone.\tPASS\t40\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:158-166\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L158-L166\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L78-L79\tTrust this uid-1000 volume in root-run Git processes. Git ignores repository-local safe.directory, so inject it into every invocation.\tPASS\t119\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:170-183\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L170-L183\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L83-L84\tRebar's region setting selects Bedrock and records provider provenance. Instance credentials resolve through IMDS, but region discovery does not.\tPASS\t140\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:185-189\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L185-L189\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L86-L86\tBotocore callers also need their own ambient region setting.\tPASS\t60\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:191-218\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L191-L218\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L88-L94\tSet all 3 model-class slots to Bedrock inference profiles. Removing these settings restores the built-in direct Anthropic defaults. Model classes preserve frontier versus standard gate routing. REBAR_LLM_MODEL is removed and must not be used. Use profile IDs from aws bedrock list-inference-profiles, including their distinct suffixes. The cutover test pins these IDs to the CI provider matrix. Update the ModelId alarm in monitoring_eb6e.tf if any ID changes.\tPASS\t321\t71\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:222-244\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L222-L244\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L98-L101\tRecord each LLM call's provider and tokens on the persistent review-bot volume. This detects stray direct Anthropic calls while retaining its credential for rollback. The JSONL sink has no rotation. Disk-pressure monitoring covers its growth. Add rotation if review volume rises.\tPASS\t299\t44\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:246-258\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L246-L258\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L103-L105\tTrigger snapshot-cache reclaim at 20% free on the gate-scratch volume. The janitor reclaims to 25% free. The prior absolute 2 GiB trigger was too late when snapshots lived on the 30 GiB root disk.\tPASS\t192\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:260-277\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L260-L277\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L107-L110\tPut both snapshot storage and per-review temporary clones on the gate-scratch EBS volume. The snapshot store reads REBAR_GATE_TMPDIR. tempfile reads TMPDIR. Keep both aligned with Terraform and the gate-scratch volume test.\tPASS\t181\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:281-283\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L281-L283\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L114-L114\tPublish host loopback for nginx. Uvicorn listens on container 8000.\tPASS\t31\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:286-295\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L286-L295\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L117-L119\tPersist the dedup ledger and reconcile cursor across redeploys. Mount the signing key read-only at the path named above. The secrets fetch creates an empty file for a blank slot to avoid a directory mount.\tPASS\t138\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:298-301\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L298-L301\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L122-L122\tPersist the tickets clone so artifact writes can auto-push.\tPASS\t46\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:303-314\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L303-L314\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L124-L127\tBind the gate-scratch volume's parent. The root-side declaration marker and in-volume proof marker must both remain visible so the admission guard detects an unmounted scratch volume. It is separate from the Gerrit site volumes created by compose-up.sh.\tPASS\t136\t43\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:316-332\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L316-L332\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L129-L132\tThe receiver calls rebar.llm directly, so REBAR_MCP_ALLOW_LLM is unused. Probe the container listener to expose a process that remains up after closing port 8000. Health is reporting only. Autodeploy uses its own /health check and Docker restart does not react to unhealthy status.\tPASS\t210\t44\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:342-347\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L342-L347\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L142-L143\tThe trusted gate sits behind SigV4 API Gateway and nginx's origin guard. It fetches authoritative state and never pushes gate workspace writes.\tPASS\t67\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:350-350\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L350-L350\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L146-L146\tBuild from the repository root for the package install.\tPASS\t13\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:355-357\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L355-L357\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L151-L151\tLoad the gate credentials and origin guard from the regenerated .env.\tPASS\t25\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:361-362\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L361-L362\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L155-L155\tMatch the trusted-environment env_id. Deploy may override it.\tPASS\t23\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:364-367\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L364-L367\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L157-L158\tMount the SSM-materialized opcert key read-only. The signer copies it to a process-owned directory and does not fetch AWS secrets.\tPASS\t62\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:369-371\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L369-L371\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L160-L160\tFetch the review main tip and read-only tickets state independently.\tPASS\t33\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:375-392\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L375-L392\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L164-L166\tNever push gate workspace writes. Trust the bridge gateway's forwarded scheme for nginx redirects. The port is host-loopback only and nginx overwrites X-Forwarded-Proto, preventing client forgery.\tPASS\t213\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:396-397\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L396-L397\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L170-L170\tPublish host loopback for nginx on 8090. Container port is 8080.\tPASS\t26\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:400-404\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L400-L404\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L173-L174\tMount the SSM-materialized key read-only at REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH. The secrets fetch creates an empty file for a blank slot.\tPASS\t65\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:409-418\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L409-L418\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L179-L181\tMCP serves authenticated Streamable HTTP behind host nginx. Non-loopback container bind requires allowlists and TLS-at-edge acknowledgment. MCP_PATHS is consumed by autodeploy for MCP blue-green redeploys.\tPASS\t106\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:422-422\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L422-L422\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L185-L185\tBuild from the repository root for the locked install.\tPASS\t14\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:427-430\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L427-L430\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L190-L191\tCover the 1200s certified-op SIGTERM grace with 60s margin. The HTTP transport test checks this relationship.\tPASS\t44\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:432-432\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L432-L432\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L193-L193\tLoad LLM credentials from the regenerated .env.\tPASS\t11\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-