/docker-compose.yml:L214-L214\tSupply the OAuth issuer required by AuthSettings to avoid startup failure.\tPASS\t35\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:471-472\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L471-L472\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L216-L216\tMount the static bearer digests file read-only.\tPASS\t19\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:474-474\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L474-L474\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L218-L218\tEnable the certified LLM gate tools.\tPASS\t11\t6\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:476-478\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L476-L478\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L220-L220\tRoute both gate temp directories to the parent-bound scratch volume.\tPASS\t39\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:485-486\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L485-L486\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L227-L227\tSign certified operations with the mounted key and environment ID.\tPASS\t24\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:489-493\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L489-L493\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L230-L230\tPersist the writable tickets clone created by the entrypoint.\tPASS\t67\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:495-502\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L495-L502\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L232-L233\tResolve attested refs in the entrypoint's persistent blobless main clone. Keep these paths aligned with autodeploy's mcp_run_new.\tPASS\t108\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:505-510\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L505-L510\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L236-L237\tPush ticket events alongside review-bot artifact writes. The event-sourced store merges concurrent writers.\tPASS\t75\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:512-527\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L512-L527\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L239-L241\tRebar's Bedrock region appears in signed provider provenance. Botocore also needs AWS_DEFAULT_REGION. Credentials come from the instance role. Keep both settings aligned with mcp_run_new.\tPASS\t171\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:530-533\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L530-L533\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L244-L245\tPass the SSM-materialized tickets PAT to the URL-scoped Git helper. A blank PAT defers cloning without blocking container startup.\tPASS\t51\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:535-548\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L535-L548\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L247-L251\tLoad Jira bridge settings from the generated .env. docker run does not interpolate Compose's project .env, so mcp_run_new must pass the env file without empty command-line overrides. Missing Jira credentials make bridge calls return typed missing-input errors while /mcp stays up. Missing bearer digests instead fail closed at startup.\tPASS\t167\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:551-552\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L551-L552\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L254-L254\tProbe scope reads JIRA_PROJECT from the environment.\tPASS\t29\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:556-557\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L556-L557\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L258-L258\tPublish host loopback for nginx on 8091.\tPASS\t26\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:560-569\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L560-L569\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L261-L263\tMount bearer digests and the opcert key read-only. The secrets fetch must create files even for blank slots. Missing bearer digests fail closed rather than serving unauthenticated MCP.\tPASS\t126\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:572-574\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L572-L574\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L266-L266\tPersist ticket events in an external site volume.\tPASS\t36\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:576-578\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L576-L578\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L268-L268\tPersist the blobless main clone in an external site volume.\tPASS\t37\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:580-581\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L580-L581\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L270-L270\tBind the scratch parent so both mount markers remain visible.\tPASS\t29\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:583-584\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L583-L584\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L272-L272\tProbe loopback /health so docker compose ps reports listener health.\tPASS\t26\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:594-598\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L594-L598\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L282-L283\tcompose-up.sh creates external EBS-backed site volumes before startup. They survive docker compose down -v without shadowing image binaries.\tPASS\t66\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:614-615\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L614-L615\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L299-L299\tPersist review-bot state on the Gerrit site volume.\tPASS\t23\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:618-619\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L618-L619\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L302-L302\tPersist the review-bot tickets clone.\tPASS\t24\t6\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:622-623\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L622-L623\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L305-L305\tPersist the MCP tickets store.\tPASS\t24\t5\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/docker-compose.yml#C:626-627\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L626-L627\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:L308-L308\tPersist the MCP blobless main clone for attested refs.\tPASS\t26\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit#C:1-17\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L1-L17\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L1-L4\tExtend Gerrit with Python and g2p so the hooks plugin runs CI hooks inside the container. Host interpreter paths cannot run there. The SSM-materialized token and config arrive through a bind mount, not the image. Site hook symlinks remain in the baked image.\tPASS\t160\t44\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit#C:22-25\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L22-L25\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L9-L10\tAlmaLinux defaults to Python 3.9. Install 3.11 for g2p and assert the minimum at build time.\tPASS\t59\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit#C:34-42\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L34-L42\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.gerrit:L19-L21\tPin g2p to a Git commit containing Gerrit 3.x compact change-ID support. The PyPI 0.3.1 release predates that fix. Git enables the VCS install above. Link all 3 installed hooks into the baked site.\tPASS\t116\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:2-15\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L2-L15\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L2-L4\tMCP serves Streamable HTTP from a locked repository-root build. The certified gates sign SSHSIG with OpenSSH 8.9 or later. The build asserts that floor.\tPASS\t122\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:21-24\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L21-L24\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L10-L11\tGit backs the ticket store. OpenSSH signs opcerts. CA roots secure the review and tickets remotes.\tPASS\t41\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:33-45\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L33-L45\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L20-L22\tPin ACLI and its architecture-specific checksum like CI. The Jira bridge shells out to acli for writes. Install arm64 on the AL2023 host and purge curl after download.\tPASS\t140\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:73-94\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L73-L94\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L50-L54\tInstall agents, MCP, and Bedrock from uv.lock. The separate Bedrock extra supplies the configured provider. Without it certified LLM gates cannot mint opcerts. Secrets and signing keys arrive through mounts. Bedrock uses the instance role, not an app-managed AWS key. Keep the uv image tag at pyproject.toml's required version. check_uv_pin enforces it.\tPASS\t301\t56\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:107-109\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L107-L109\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L67-L67\tProbe unauthenticated loopback /health with the installed Python.\tPASS\t36\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:113-142\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L113-L142\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L71-L76\tEntrypoint provisions a persistent writable tickets clone from the tickets branch. Its URL-scoped credential keeps the PAT off disk and out of remote URLs. The shared ensure script adds identity and store marker. A missing PAT or failed clone does not block server startup. It also creates a blobless main clone for attested gate refs because the image source copy has no Git object database.\tPASS\t334\t66\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp#C:147-151\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L147-L151\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp:L81-L81\tInstall the tested entrypoint file on PATH, then start MCP over HTTP.\tPASS\t68\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert#C:2-13\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L2-L13\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L2-L3\tTrusted opcert service from a locked repository-root build. The build asserts OpenSSH 8.9 or later for SSHSIG signing.\tPASS\t98\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert#C:19-22\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L19-L22\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L9-L9\tGit backs the store. OpenSSH signs opcerts. CA roots secure remotes.\tPASS\t40\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert#C:33-44\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L33-L44\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.opcert:L20-L23\tLock agents, reviewbot, and Bedrock extras for the gate service. reviewbot currently brings boto3, but the explicit Bedrock extra keeps the provider dependency intentional. The signing key arrives through a mount. Keep the uv image tag at pyproject.toml's required version.\tPASS\t174\t42\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:2-23\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L2-L23\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L2-L4\tReview-bot webhook receiver built from the repository root. The root .dockerignore excludes Git, virtualenvs, tracker data, and SSM-sourced .env from the image context. The Python base supports arm64.\tPASS\t145\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:32-38\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L32-L38\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L13-L15\tGit backs the store. OpenSSH 8.9 or later signs event authorship. Without it, the review-bot could write unsigned events. CA roots secure the scanner installer's HTTPS download.\tPASS\t90\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:43-46\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L43-L46\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L20-L21\tInstall the locked offline scanners for fail-closed code review. The deployment lane is linux/arm64.\tPASS\t58\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:60-97\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L60-L97\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L35-L39\tInstall agents, reviewbot, and Bedrock from uv.lock. The agents extra includes local web search for blocking plan reviews. The Bedrock provider currently imports through reviewbot's boto3 dependency, but declaring its own extra keeps the dependency locked if reviewbot changes. Keep the uv image tag at pyproject.toml's required version.\tPASS\t456\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:103-107\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L103-L107\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L45-L45\tInstall the shared tickets-store ensure helper for boot convergence.\tPASS\t67\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:115-128\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L115-L128\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L53-L56\tData-capture entrypoint. The entrypoint clones a persistent tickets branch and configures a URL-scoped PAT helper so artifact events can auto-push. Without a PAT, reviews still boot while artifact push stays disabled.\tPASS\t152\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot#C:153-155\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L153-L155\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/Dockerfile.reviewbot:L81-L81\tRun uvicorn on container 8000 behind nginx's published host port.\tPASS\t45\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:1-9\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L1-L9\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L1-L3\tGerrit site config lives on EBS at /var/gerrit/site/etc. The image seeds an empty site, then reads this file behind nginx TLS. Gerrit 3.x stores metadata in NoteDb.\tPASS\t79\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:12-13\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L12-L13\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L6-L6\tMatch the public nginx origin and Compose canonical URL.\tPASS\t20\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:15-18\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L15-L18\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L8-L8\tSet the repository path explicitly so reseeding cannot remove it.\tPASS\t53\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:20-21\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L20-L21\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L10-L10\tKeep serverId stable across container recreation for NoteDb refs.\tPASS\t23\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:25-27\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L25-L27\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L14-L14\tTrust HTTPS proxy headers and publish HTTP on host loopback.\tPASS\t37\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:29-29\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L29-L29\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L16-L16\tBound the HTTP thread pool for the small host.\tPASS\t12\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:31-32\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L31-L32\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L18-L18\tLog HTTP requests to inspect encoded-slash proxy handling.\tPASS\t21\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:36-37\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L36-L37\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L22-L22\tGerrit SSH is separate from host administration through SSM.\tPASS\t22\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:39-41\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L39-L41\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L24-L24\tBound total and per-connection batch SSH workers for 8 GiB RAM.\tPASS\t43\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:46-47\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L46-L47\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L29-L29\tLeave RAM for the OS, mmap, and review-bot beside the 2 GiB heap.\tPASS\t28\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:49-54\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L49-L54\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L31-L32\tPin JDK 21 home. Gerrit's old tools.jar discovery loop cannot find that removed file and otherwise prevents JVM startup.\tPASS\t81\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:56-57\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L56-L57\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L34-L34\tRetain Gerrit's JDK 21 module-access flags on reseed.\tPASS\t25\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:63-66\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L63-L66\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L40-L40\tLimit packed-git mmap outside the JVM heap to 1 GiB.\tPASS\t54\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:70-77\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L70-L77\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L44-L46\tUse GitHub OAuth for people and HTTP passwords for service users. Install the OAuth plugin and SSM client credentials before startup. See gerrit-auth-hardening.md for rollback.\tPASS\t99\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:79-80\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L79-L80\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L48-L48\tHTTP password still authenticates service users under OAuth.\tPASS\t26\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:85-86\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L85-L86\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L53-L53\tcompose-up.sh puts the SSM client ID here and secret in secure.config.\tPASS\t28\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:90-91\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L90-L91\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L57-L57\tLucene indexes NoteDb metadata on this host.\tPASS\t27\t7\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:95-95\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L95-L95\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L61-L61\tNo push-cert keyring is provisioned.\tPASS\t12\t6\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:99-103\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L99-L103\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L65-L66\tSubmit topics atomically across open partner changes. Use rebar-prefixed topics to avoid cross-repository collisions.\tPASS\t65\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\r\ninfra/compose/gerrit.config#C:107-121\t9800670821a3e25f3301026c0fb1271b1176e20a:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L107-L121\tdd70464a865e08ead67a883d0354c90366d01680:infra/compose/gerrit.config:L70-L73\tDisable outbound mail to avoid refused localhost SMTP attempts. Gerrit otherwise defaults to 127.0.0.1:25 without an MTA. Restart Gerrit after changing this setting. See the outbound-mail runbook for the lost notifications and re-enable procedure.\tPASS\t172\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792793364987080460,"uuid":"34977892-8dc9-4d02-850d-f092ce2d631d"}